    "created_at": "2018-02-16T11:20:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-16T11:20:27Z",
    "body": "> Of course by that reading I think we end up with an infinite redirect loop to itself, at least until the 20-redirect-limit is hit. So that seems like a spec bug too.\r\n\r\nWhy? If you instead put in the parsed-then-serialized URL you'd get the same result.\r\n\r\nI agree that extracting header values needs to be improved at some point...",
